# ===========================================================================
# Large files never enter this repository (GitHub refuses a push over 100 MB,
# and warns from 50 MB). Git cannot ignore by size, so the places a large file
# can appear are ignored by path:
#
#   tools/node_modules/**  the dev dependencies — onnxruntime's native
#                          libraries (~40 MB) and sharp's libvips (~18 MB) —
#                          and, inside them, the transformers.js model cache:
#                          .../multilingual-e5-small/onnx/model_quantized.onnx
#                          112.8 MB, written the first time a build embeds.
#   **/.cache/**           the same cache wherever it is pointed at
#
# Nothing large is required to clone or run the app:
#   - the browser downloads the embedding model from Hugging Face when a search
#     needs it (it is kept in the browser cache, not in the repo), and
#   - the build tools fetch the same model on their first run
#     (tools/lib/embedder.mjs; HADITH_MODEL_CACHE moves that cache elsewhere).
#
# Re-check before committing:
#   Get-ChildItem -Recurse -File -Force | Where-Object Length -gt 99MB
# ===========================================================================

# dev-only dependencies (and the model cache inside them)
node_modules/
**/.cache/
.model-cache/
*.onnx

# scraped source pages — the JSON in HadithData/ is the source of truth
data/

# editors, OS, scratch
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.log
*.tmp
